                        install the plugin on the sites needing to be backed-up.'=>'An "Add-on Site" is a separate WordPress site residing in subdirectories within this site. If you confirm these to be separate sites, 
                        then it is recommended that you exclude them by ticking the corresponding boxes below and clicking the \'Add Filters & Rescan\' button. To backup the other sites 
                        install the plugin on the sites needing to be backed up.','No large files found during this scan.  If you\'re having issues building a Backup click the back button and try adding a file filter to non-essential files paths like wp-content/uploads.   These excluded files can then be manually moved to the new location after you have ran the migration installer.'=>'No large files found during this scan.  If you\'re having issues building a Backup click the back button and try adding a file filter to non-essential files paths like wp-content/uploads.   These excluded files can then be manually moved to the new location after you have ran the migration installer.','Files over %1$s are listed below. Larger files such as movies or zipped content can cause timeout issues on some budget hosts.  If you are having issues creating a Backup try excluding the directory paths below or go back to Step 1 and add them.'=>'Files over %1$s are listed below. Larger files such as movies or zipped content can cause timeout issues on some budget hosts.  If you are having issues creating a Backup try excluding the directory paths below or go back to Step 1 and add them.','%s size in bytesThis notice is triggered at [%s] and can be ignored on most hosts.  If during the build process you see a "Host Build Interrupt" message then this host has strict processing limits.  Below are some options you can take to overcome constraints set up on this host.'=>'This notice is triggered at [%s] and can be ignored on most hosts.  If during the build process you see a "Host Build Interrupt" message then this host has strict processing limits.  Below are some options you can take to overcome constraints set up on this host.',' Disable the advanced option to re-enable file controls.'=>' Disable the advanced option to re-enable file controls.','All file checks are skipped. This could cause problems during extraction if problematic files are included.'=>'All file checks are skipped. This could cause problems during extraction if problematic files are included.','This size includes only files BEFORE compression is applied. It does not include the size of the database script or any applied filters.  Once complete the Backup size will be smaller than this number.'=>'This size includes only files BEFORE compression is applied. It does not include the size of the database script or any applied filters.  Once complete the Backup size will be smaller than this number.','A Backup is being processed. Retry later.'=>'A Backup is being processed. Retry later.','Alert!'=>'Alert!','No selections made! Please select at least one Backup to delete.'=>'No selections made! Please select at least one Backup to delete.','No selections made! Please select an action from the "Bulk Actions" drop down menu.'=>'No selections made! Please select an action from the "Bulk Actions" drop down menu.','Items'=>'Items','Current Server Time'=>'Current Server Time','To stop or reset this Backup build goto Settings > Advanced > Reset Backups'=>'To stop or reset this Backup build goto Settings > Advanced > Reset Backups','Backup Build Running'=>'Backup Build Running','For any issues in this section please contact your hosting provider or server administrator.  For additional information see our online documentation.'=>'For any issues in this section please contact your hosting provider or server administrator.  For additional information see our online documentation.','Safe Mode should be set to Off in you php.ini file and is deprecated as of PHP 5.3.0.'=>'Safe Mode should be set to Off in you php.ini file and is deprecated as of PHP 5.3.0.','PHP versions 5.2.9+ or higher is required.'=>'PHP versions 5.2.9+ or higher is required.','Set up one-time storage locations and automatically push the Backup to your destination.'=>'Set up one-time storage locations and automatically push the Backup to your destination.','Show/Hide Password'=>'Show/Hide Password','Duplicator Pro allows you to 